"en": "Well, it's more accurate to say I'm a UFO hobbyist.\nThere are an alarming number of them here in Onomichi.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15904,
"en": "I'd love to get a picture of one, but I've been trying for\nthe last ten days straight and still haven't managed...",
