"max": null
},
{
"id": 15914,
"en": "Thanks to you, I got tons of photos!\nI can go home in peace now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15915,
"en": "You have my deepest thanks!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15916,
"en": "Man, that's some nice wood you have there.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15917,
"en": "Oh, pardon me. I make a hobby of gathering driftwood\nand other things that have washed ashore.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15918,
"en": "It excites me to think about the path these objects must\nhave traveled over the years. They're potential globetrotters!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15919,
"en": "I could only dream of living such a free, romantic life.",
