"max": null
},
{
"id": 15928,
"en": "Please let me thank you! Well then, I should be going now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15929,
"en": "I can't find anything good...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15930,
"en": "Oh, Kiryu-san. I have a bit of a favor to ask you...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15931,
"en": "I got a request to stock up on some more fish, and\nI was wondering if you could get them for me. Please!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15932,
"en": "It would be amazing if you could do this for me.\nI'll be counting on you!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15933,
"en": "Here you go!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15934,
"en": "Um... Do you have a minute, sir?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15935,
"en": "You seem to be quite a strong individual,\nand... you clearly hold justice in your heart.",
