"max": null
},
{
"id": 15936,
"en": "Your eyes are a dead giveaway.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15937,
"en": "You may even be the one\nwho can save this city.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15938,
"en": "I'm getting ahead of myself, though.\nI'm Torafuru.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15939,
"en": "This city has gone to the dogs.\nViolence and crime are spreading like a plague.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15940,
"en": "Even the police are struggling...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15941,
"en": "At this rate, we'll hit a point of no return\nbefore the police can even act...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15942,
"en": "Not even civilians are safe now...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15943,
"en": "So, I set up a social network specifically\nto help get things under wraps<symbol=em_dash_with_outline>Troublr.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15944,
"en": "Whenever an incident occurs in town,\npeople can post about it and seek help.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15945,
"en": "The more we help, the safer we make our home.\nThat's why I was hoping you'd lend us a hand.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15946,
"en": "Kiryu-san, then? Thank you very much.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15947,
"en": "I'll register you on Troublr now...\nThere we go!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15948,
"en": "From now on, you'll get notifications about incidents\naround town. Please help out if you have the time.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15949,
"en": "Well, I have high hopes for you.\nLet's make Kamurocho a safe place to live again!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15950,
"en": "Huh? Oh, Kiryu-san!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15951,
"en": "It's me, Torafuru.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15952,
"en": "Funny meeting you in such an isolated place!\nThis is actually where my parents live.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15953,
"en": "You know, Onomichi has gotten pretty dangerous\nas well, lately... though not quite as bad as Kamurocho.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15954,
"en": "To make sure this sleepy town stays asleep,\nI've set up a Troublr network here as well.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15955,
"en": "You'll be getting notifications about incidents in Onomichi\nnow, too, so please help out if you have the time.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15956,
"en": "Well, I'll be counting on you. Let's work hard \nto make sure Onomichi stays pristine!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15957,
"en": "I-I'm so sorry. I just got so sick of seeing\nthe sorry state Kamurocho finds itself in.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15958,
"en": "I thought there was only one course of action for a rotten\ncity like this... It needed to be burned to the ground.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15959,
"en": "But seeing you rush to extinguish my fires every time\nmade me think maybe I wasn't doing the right thing...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15960,
"en": "Thanks to you, I can see the true beauty of this city.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15961,
"en": "Even though not everyone shows it, the people of Kamurocho care\ndeeply about their surroundings and want them to improve.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15962,
"en": "I hope you can find it in your heart to forgive me.\nFor now though, I'm going to turn myself in to the police.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15963,
"en": "I don't know when I'll be able to come back to this city,\nbut I'm going to work hard to improve it once I can.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15964,
"en": "P-Please forgive me...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15965,
"en": "The thing is, nothing has been going right for me at work.\nMy supervisors don't like me, everyone makes fun of me...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15966,
"en": "The stress was so great that\neven my hair started falling out.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15967,
"en": "At first I just wanted to start a little fire...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15968,
"en": "But as I gazed upon its glowing embers,\nfor once in my life I actually felt alive.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15969,
"en": "It was the perfect way to relieve stress.\nI couldn't stop myself from starting more and more fires.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15970,
"en": "But thanks to you, I see the truth now.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15971,
"en": "I really appreciate the efforts you went through to stop me.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15972,
"en": "I... I'm going to turn myself in.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15973,
"en": "I know that won't erase the damage I've caused, but I hope\nI can at least somewhat atone for my sins. Goodbye, then.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15974,
"en": "L-Listen. I have this important ramen order to deliver,\nbut I strained my back right as I was setting out...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15975,
"en": "It's for a really terrifying customer, though.\nThere'll be blood if the noodles are soggy at all.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15976,
"en": "We probably have about two minutes until that happens...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15977,
"en": "We probably have about three minutes until that happens...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15978,
"en": "We probably have about four minutes until that happens...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15979,
"en": "We probably have about five minutes until that happens...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15980,
"en": "I'm sorry to ask this, but do you think\nyou could deliver it for me instead?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15981,
"en": "I'll send the location to your Troublr.\nI'm counting on you!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15982,
"en": "I'll send the location to your email.\nI'm counting on you!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15983,
"en": "Thank you so much! You were a huge help!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15984,
"en": "I see... Okay, then. I'm Kiryu.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_imssn|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15985,
"en": "Kiryu's arrest was just a performance\nto win back some public approval.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15986,
"en": "A performance?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15987,
"en": "There's no doubt the Omi Alliance\nwas responsible for the war...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15988,
"en": "...but to the public, the Tojo Clan and\nthe Omi Alliance are equally problematic.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15989,
"en": "If the cops didn't take in someone\nfrom both sides, people would riot.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15990,
"en": "Well, I guess they're just trying to\nprove they can still do their jobs.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15991,
"en": "Kiryu <font_kind=yakuza_italic>was</font_kind> kinda the fourth\nchairman of the Tojo Clan.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15992,
"en": "That said, he's also the one who stuck his\nneck out\n furthest to end the fighting.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15993,
"en": "Can't you do something, Date-san?\nIsn't Kiryu-san your responsibility?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15994,
"en": "He's nobody's \"responsibility.\"\nHe's not a child.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15995,
"en": "Besides, why is Kiryu-san the only\nguy getting arrested here anyway?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15996,
"en": "I heard the Tojo Clan officers aren't\neven getting slapped on the wrist.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15997,
"en": "The cops could round up all the Tojo officers,\nbut who'd\n be left to keep the clan in check?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15998,
"en": "If the police ended up reigniting this\nyakuza war after it finally ended...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 15999,
"en": "...It'd be their necks on the line.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16000,
"en": "And that's why they're still treating\nKiryu-san as part of the Tojo Clan?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16001,
"en": "He's far more than just\nthe ex-fourth chairman.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16002,
"en": "Kazuma Kiryu is the Dragon of Dojima.\nA yakuza legend.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 16003,
"en": "No matter how far removed he is\nfrom\n that, he's no regular civilian.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_main01|#",
"max": null
}
]